PRIVATE REFLECTION: {
The deliberation remains in unanimous consensus that B. RGDSPSS is the correct choice. The Ser-Pro residues following the canonical RGD motif intrinsically stabilize the bioactive turn geometry required for integrin pocket engagement, consistent with classical fibronectin-derived reference peptides. Alternative sequences, including RGDLTTP, fail to provide the required structural conformation or consensus context for effective in vitro integrin binding. B. RGDSPSS will be finalized in the concluding round.
}

